    smf_native_codegen_data_rel_ro_subsection_2026_11_09, 0, "Phase-2 gate lane (PR #8047): with a recorded MC/DC-off waiver the real SMF compiled path runs but fails closed — child SIGBUS / 'SMF imports/relocations ... .data.rel.ro.subsection' codegen error (aarch64). Blocks compiled-path test evidence at phase 2. Owner: backend codegen lane. Repro: phase-2 lane gap item 3 in PR #8047."

